title: '[[id:fc5df1db-2e18-4337-b8c7-7e238647b46a][consuming another''s changes, as skg stood on 2026-11-12]]'
pid: b6cc2833-4f54-4526-bb1b-4c780037eb35
body: |2-
  Seven wishes from one night of reading a week of Jeff's changes with
  his skgrepo foreign to me, each with the attempt behind it, and a
  comparison with his own sketch. The first: skg shows nothing of what
  changed in a skgrepo I do not own; only Git told me where to look.
